{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Totem Mask is a ",["l","帽子","hat"]," that can be ",["l","裁缝#Hats","tailored"]," at the sewing machine inside ",["l","柳巷2号","Emily's house"]," or the ",["l","缝纫机","Sewing Machine"]," received as a reward for the ",["l","任务#Rock Rejuvenation","\"Rock Rejuvenation\""]," special order. It requires ",["l","布料","Cloth"]," and either a ",["l","雨水图腾","Rain Totem"],", ",["l","传送图腾：农场","Warp Totem: Farm"],", ",["l","传送图腾：山岭","Warp Totem: Mountains"],", ",["l","传送图腾：海滩","Warp Totem: Beach"],", ",["l","传送图腾：沙漠","Warp Totem: Desert"],", ",["l","传送图腾：姜岛","Warp Totem: Island"],", or ",["l","宝藏图腾","Treasure Totem"],". It can also be obtained from ",["l","沙漠节#Emily's Outfit Services","Emily's outfit services"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"],". Male players have a ≈2% chance to receive the outfit with the Totem Mask."]]]],["Notes",2,[["l",0,[[1,["The Totem Mask outfit also includes the ",["f","Shirt153.png",24]," ",["l","裁缝#Shirts","Fake Muscles Shirt"]," (dyed RGB value 249,174,137) and ",["f","Shorts.png",24]," ",["l","裁缝#Pants","Shorts"]," (dyed RGB value 18,140,23)."]]]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.4","1.4"],": Introduced."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5","1.5"],": Can be made using Warp Totem: Island."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": Can be made using Treasure Totem. Can now be randomly obtained as part of an outfit from the Desert Festival."]]]]]]]}